\cf2 These operations automatically handle the necessary synchronization and shared memory management internally, making them both easier to use correctly and often more efficient than manually implementing equivalent functionality with 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 barrier()
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  and shared memory operations.\
